---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ModulesList from '../../components/ModulesList.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Modules"
  description="Lumen's eight modules: which ones exist already and which are planned."
  lang="it"
  altHref="/en/modules/"
>
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Modules</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Lumen is made of eight independent modules, all built on the same senses engine. Not all of
      them have been built yet. This list is fetched directly from <a href="https://github.com/lumen-assistive/lumen-plugins">lumen-plugins</a> at
      build time, so it cannot drift from what the repository actually contains.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="wide">
    <ModulesList />

    <p>
      Modules marked "Planned" have no code yet: they are added as a package in <code>lumen-plugins</code> once their development phase starts, per the
      project's public roadmap. Want to contribute one? See the <a href="/docs/contributing/plugins/">guide to building a plugin</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
